abstract: >-
  Research code for community supply adequacy, hurricane recovery, data-center emergency support, internal-service protection, and incremental export-enablement economics.
  GraphRL-A2C provides frozen repair sequences, with policy comparisons retained
  as supporting evidence. The assessment uses a benchmark-derived synthetic
  distribution testbed and prescribed emergency-support connections.
keywords:
  - Data centers
  - Power distribution systems
  - Supply adequacy
  - Disaster resilience
  - Emergency support
  - Hurricane recovery
